                        "arabic_name": "إِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَبِٱلْمِرْصَادِ",
                        "translated_name": "Your Lord is certainly in wait."
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 6008,
                        "chapter_id": 89,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "15",
                        "arabic_name": "فَأَمَّا ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ إِذَا مَا ٱبْتَلَىٰهُ رَبُّهُۥ فَأَكْرَمَهُۥ وَنَعَّمَهُۥ فَيَقُولُ رَبِّىٓ أَكْرَمَنِ",
                        "translated_name": "As for man, whenever his Lord tries him and then is gracious and provides good things for him, he says: \"My Lord has been gracious to me.\""
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 6009,
                        "chapter_id": 89,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "16",
                        "arabic_name": "وَأَمَّآ إِذَا مَا ٱبْتَلَىٰهُ فَقَدَرَ عَلَيْهِ رِزْقَهُۥ فَيَقُولُ رَبِّىٓ أَهَـٰنَنِ",
                        "translated_name": "But when He tries him by restraining his means, he says: \"My Lord despises me.\""
